# Public browser build inputs for the Cloudflare PoC branch.
# Copy to the repository root .env only when these optional inputs are needed.
# Runtime bindings and required secrets live in each Worker's wrangler.jsonc;
# see docs/operations.md. Never place Worker secrets in VITE_ variables.

# Google One Tap: use the public client ID matching the app Worker credentials.
# Register https://cf-poc.mytuums.com as an authorized JavaScript origin.
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Public GA4 measurement ID. Unset disables browser analytics.
# VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=

# The PoC build selects Google, Discord and Twitch sign-in buttons in Vite config.
# D1/R2, Stream, Images, Email Service and Workflows use native bindings.
# App and jobs share APPEAL_TOKEN_SECRET; BETTER_AUTH_SECRET belongs to the app.
# The .env file is not loaded by the Worker runtime or D1 administration tools.
# For the Vite development proxy, set RPC_TARGET in the launching process.
# Interactive local app/jobs wiring is still incomplete; native tests need no secrets.
